# When present, EAS Build uses this INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide what to
# upload. It exists for one reason: `assets/webroot.zip` is gitignored (it is a
# build artifact) but must reach the build, because that zip IS the app — a
# wrapper uploaded without it compiles fine and launches to a blank screen.
# Keep `assets/webroot.zip` absent from this list.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
*.log

# Generated by `expo prebuild`, which runs on the EAS worker.
#
# LEADING SLASHES ARE LOAD-BEARING, exactly as in .gitignore: a bare `ios/`
# matches at every level, which would drop `modules/icloud-store/ios` from the
# upload — and the build would then compile a wrapper with no iCloud bridge in
# it.
/ios/
/android/

# Credentials and local environment. Kept out of the upload for the same
# reason they are kept out of git: nothing here is needed to build the app.
.env
.env*.local
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
play-service-account.json
